    if (length(yaml_end) >= 2) {
      content_start <- yaml_end[2] + 1L
    }
  }

  return(content_start)
}
```

But `skill_content` might be empty or have no frontmatter. Let me use the same naming: maybe `get_markdown_content_start`.

I'll call it something like `get_content_start_after_yaml` or simply `find_content_start`. Let me go with `get_content_start`:

